            "heading": "What the story should help the listener understand",
            "content": "The listener should be able to see the arc of your journey and understand what you are aiming for; Moesta also says the story should let them feel that journey. Make it intriguing enough to prompt follow-up questions, rather than trying to tell everything at once.",
